# {{NAME}}

Local Stagepass project for Webflow.

## Setup

```bash
npm install
stagepass build
stagepass link {{NAME}}
```

`stagepass link` without `--origin` uses the hosts from `stagepass.json` (`origin` / optional `production`). Activate on your staging site: `https://{{STAGING_HOST}}/?stagepass={{NAME}}.sp`

## Scripts

| Script | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| `stagepass build` | Production bundle: content hashes, SRI, and `dist/manifest.json` |
| `stagepass watch` | Rebuild stable `dist/main.js` and `dist/styles.css` only |
| `stagepass dev` | Watch plus live reload |

Hashes and `manifest.json` come only from `stagepass build`. `stagepass watch` and `stagepass dev` write only the stable files and leave the manifest as the last production build. `stagepass upgrade` does not rewrite an existing `scripts/build.mjs`; copy the current template by hand to pick this up.

## Webflow Custom Code

Prefer the major CDN pin `@2`. An exact pin is optional (see `data-stagepass-version`).

