{{FOOTER_SNIPPET}}
```

After each production upload, set `data-src` / `data-href` to your hosted URLs. For content-hashed uploads, read `file` from `dist/manifest.json` (last `stagepass build`). Local swapping uses the stable `dist/main.js` and `dist/styles.css` copies.

### Subresource Integrity (SRI)

`stagepass build` writes a sha384 `integrity` per output in `dist/manifest.json`:

```json
{
  "main.js": {
    "file": "main.a1b2c3d4.js",
    "integrity": "sha384-..."
  },
  "styles.css": {
    "file": "styles.e5f6a7b8.css",
    "integrity": "sha384-..."
  }
}
```

Use those values on production tags (and keep `crossorigin="anonymous"` when the asset host sends CORS headers):

```html
<script
  src="https://cdn.example.com/{{NAME}}/main.a1b2c3d4.js"
  integrity="sha384-..."
  crossorigin="anonymous"
  data-stagepass
  data-src="https://cdn.example.com/{{NAME}}/main.a1b2c3d4.js"
  data-stagepass-path="/dist/main.js"
></script>
```

